id: pm-web-ireq
title: Use the pm SDK for workspace settings and initialization checks
description: "Replace the two 2026-10-25 audit findings with SDK read-snapshot settings writes and explicit-root tracker preflight. Preserve opaque settings, concurrent changes, privacy and integrity; prove behavior against public tracker copies and record per-replacement revert evidence. Related SDK adoption: pm-web-8pml and pm-web-cvny."
